<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Casinos Austria sees difficult 1997.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Casinos Austria sees difficult 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casinos Austria International Ltd (CAIL) said on Friday it expects market conditions in 1997 to continue to be difficult after reporting a net loss of A$18.47 million in calendar 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;While operating performance in the second half of 1996 was encouraging, CAIL expects market conditions in 1997 will still continue to be difficult,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>CAIL, which is controlled by Vienna-based Casinos Austria AG, said the 1996 loss was mainly due to the write-down in its investment in Reef Casinos Trust.</p>
<p>CAIL shares closed one cent lower at 26 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
